            "notes": "This round is about getting money so I usually play really safe behind team and cover to  heal my team and not die. \n\n\nThe powers for this entire build are pretty situational but [Sleep Regimen](item_28934e4f-0668-482e-b10d-a5d557cc3b1e) is a must because it gives big health. I usually take it round 1 when there are easy sleeps on the enemy team like rein, orisa, reaper... however if you aren't confident in hitting them without tranquilizer then take either [No Scope Needed](item_823db5eb-5a24-4bac-b850-0aa34e76b4f6) \n\nIF you are confident in hitting your crits then get [Pinpoint Prescription](item_5cfa07d8-7b5d-42df-a9a8-c6a580acb8bc)",
