            "created_at": "2025-10-01T21:43:13.777954+00:00",
            "notes": "Again the powers are optional so do as you wish, the nano stuff is good though because you farm it pretty easily.\n\n[Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) and [Hardlight Accelerator](item_0390c8af-2a68-4da2-b876-93da32c3f448) and [The Closer](item_173c6d0f-dbe6-440e-924f-0ce08189ddce) and [Unscoped Resources](item_64c401f6-7508-4fc7-ac3a-93c9f3f57e2b) are interchangeable WITH EACH OTHER, **not** with any other items in the build!!! so choose whichever best fits your match and playstyle\n\n[Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) and [The Closer](item_173c6d0f-dbe6-440e-924f-0ce08189ddce) are great standard [Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power) items.\n\n[Hardlight Accelerator](item_0390c8af-2a68-4da2-b876-93da32c3f448) works with [Dash Boots](item_1ec670c7-a465-4ca0-9d16-aeeedab7894e) so you get stacks pretty easily plus [Cooldown Reduction](stat_cooldown_reduction) is nice.\n\n[Unscoped Resources](item_64c401f6-7508-4fc7-ac3a-93c9f3f57e2b) is pretty underrated to me I feel like I barely have to reload most of the time.\n\n\nYou should be hopping around and out playing anybody that dives you if you are aware and managing cooldowns right",
